    body = [=[
=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Jaucribaix} in {z:Norg} (K-8), near the Captain's Chamber, to begin the quest.
* Speak to {n:Aeka} (I-8) to receive {@i:Oriental Steel|1151} {i:Oriental Steel|Oriental Steel|1151}.
* Speak to {n:Ranemaud} (I-7) to receive a {@i:Sacred Sprig|1198} {i:Sacred Sprig|Sacred Sprig|1198}.
* Travel to {z:Konschtat Highlands} (D-8), trade the {@i:Oriental Steel|1151} {i:Oriental Steel|Oriental Steel|1151} to the **???** inside the cave to spawn a {p:Bomb|Category:Bomb} {p:Notorious Monster|Category:Notorious Monsters} named {m:Forger}, approximately level 33.
** The level 99 Unity warp (Sleepy Mabel) will place you close to this point at (G-7).
* Once the {m:Forger} is defeated, a {@i:Bomb Steel|1152} {i:Bomb Steel|Bomb Steel|1152} will drop.
** If you are defeated while fighting the {m:Forger} or somehow lose the {@i:Bomb Steel|1152} {i:Bomb Steel|Bomb Steel|1152} before the next part, Aeka can give you another {@i:Oriental Steel|1151} {i:Oriental Steel|Oriental Steel|1151} in exchange for a {@i:Darksteel Ore|645} {i:Darksteel Ore|Darksteel Ore|645}.
** If you are doing the quest for multiple people, you must wait 4 minutes to re-spawn the {m:Forger} for another {@i:Bomb Steel|1152} {i:Bomb Steel|Bomb Steel|1152}.
* Purchase a {@i:Hatchet|1021} {i:Hatchet|Hatchet|1021} and travel to {z:The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah}. You will find an area off of the map in the northern part of (K-10) that will take you to a block at (L-9). There you will find a **???** spot you may reach by climbing up a nearby rock. Trade the {@i:Hatchet|1021} {i:Hatchet|Hatchet|1021} to the **???** spot to spawn a {p:Treant|Category:Treant} Notorious Monster named {m:Guardian Treant}.
** {@i:Trbl. Hatchet|6004} {i:Trailblazing Hatchet|Trbl. Hatchet|6004} does not work. It must be a regular Hatchet.
** The level 122 Unity warp (Keeper of Heiligtum) will place you close to this point at (K-12).
** If you are doing the quest for multiple people, you only need to kill the Treant once.
*** The Treant has a minimum respawn time of 10 minutes, so make sure everyone has the {@i:Sacred Sprig|1198} {i:Sacred Sprig|Sacred Sprig|1198} before proceeding.
* Once the Treant is defeated, trade the {@i:Sacred Sprig|1198} {i:Sacred Sprig|Sacred Sprig|1198} to the **???** to receive a {@i:Sacred Branch|1153} {i:Sacred Branch|Sacred Branch|1153}.
* Trade the {@i:Bomb Steel|1152} {i:Bomb Steel|Bomb Steel|1152} and the {@i:Sacred Branch|1153} {i:Sacred Branch|Sacred Branch|1153} to Jaucribaix.
* Return in 72 in-game hours (3 real-life hours) to receive your reward.

=2 Notes
* The {@i:Mumeito|17809} {p:Mumeito} is required to do the AF1 quest: {q:The Sacred Katana|The Sacred Katana|The Sacred Katana}. If you plan on levelling Samurai, it would be wise to hold on to it, otherwise you will have to pay Ranemaud 30,000 gil for a replacement.

